
# The @term/blog app index. A small full-stack example on @term/site: a Postgres-backed posts API plus a DOM
# frontend, laid out in the application folder convention.
#
#   back/post   the repository (post model + queries over the abstract db)
#   hook/blog   the HTTP API (trie-routed handlers) plus the `boot` entry `seed boot` runs
#   face/blog   the frontend (DOM app)
#   book/       guides
#
# Run it:  seed boot   (reads deck.tree's `boot ./hook/blog`)
